sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as Web client
    participant P2 as Invitations API
    participant P3 as RabbitMQ
    participant P4 as Worker
    participant P5 as MinIO
    participant P6 as Download endpoint
    P1->>P2: Request owned export
    P2->>P3: Check status / expiry
    P3->>P4: Fetch private objects
    P4->>P5: Stream download
    P5->>P6: Record access result
    P6-->>P1: Résultat / statut vérifié
